# The fixed signature has no system-controlled variables. The current DSL
# compiler rejects an actually empty top-level system declaration as missing, so
# use a quoted empty placeholder to satisfy DSL structure without adding a
# named system variable from the requirements.
system ""

# The natural-language requirements define Dim as 0..7 and a moveDist predicate
# allowing stutter or +/-1 next-state movement. Runtime controller tests observe
# declared controller inputs/outputs only; with no system outputs and an
# array-valued environment input, those semantic constraints are not soundly
# expressible as bounded black-box controller tests in this DSL.

test declared_guard_input:
  kind variable_ownership
  env guard
